  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VN-Second Payment System and Bank Modernization Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&apos;s Development Objectives are to assist Vietnam&apos;s banking sector to (i)meet the demands of the economy for fast, reliable and safe payment services, (ii)broaden access to finance to facilitate the achievement of the government&apos;s povertyreduction targets, and (iii) improve the operations of the participating banks through theexpansion of the IBPS and the CBS.</narrative>
  </description>
